  "construction": "The polynomial family is supplied. New Lean proves the universal I3 polynomial identity and vanishing for all triples iff quartic coefficient is zero; one zero triple is insufficient. The QZeta12 norm coordinates of source vPlus/vMinus are computed using the actual basis multiplication/conjugation. R_AB has Galois comparison difference8B, so invariance is B=0 in that basis. Equal embedding weights use different coordinates and must not be identified with A=B; the source A=B=1 example produces11 versus3.",
